              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orogongo rwabo nigo rwabwateranetie naende ekeng’ese kia Gileadi amo n’Asitaroti, na Edirei, emechie emenene y’oborwoti bw’Ogi, omorwoti o Basani. Eyio nigo yarwetwe ase kera eamate y’ekeng’ese ki’egesaku kia Makiri, mosinto o Manase, ekaba omwando obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.13.31"
            ]
          }
        }
